mira-ai — third-party notices
=============================

This crate is a Rust translation of parts of the Pi AI package
(`@earendil-works/pi-ai`, `packages/ai`) from the Pi repository, reference commit
`a276dabe5`. The translated design and algorithms come from:

- `packages/ai/src/types.ts`
- `packages/ai/src/utils/event-stream.ts`
- `packages/ai/src/utils/transcript.ts`
- `packages/ai/src/api/transform-messages.ts`
- `packages/ai/src/api/openai-completions.ts`

The crate is not a line-by-line port: it keeps the important invariants and replaces the
JavaScript mechanics with Rust ownership, bounded event delivery and explicit error types.
The intentional differences are listed in README.md.

